    <briefdescription>
<para>SmallVector-backed <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_memory_buffer" kindref="compound">MemoryBuffer</ref> instance. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class enables efficient construction of MemoryBuffers from <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_small_vector" kindref="compound">SmallVector</ref> instances. This is useful for <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_m_c_j_i_t" kindref="compound">MCJIT</ref> and Orc, where object files are streamed into SmallVectors, then inspected using <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_object_file" kindref="compound">ObjectFile</ref> (which takes a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_memory_buffer" kindref="compound">MemoryBuffer</ref>). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
